gn:center;white-space:nowrap;color:#6b7280\">N</td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;text-align:center\"><span style=\"background:#dcfce7;color:#166534;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 5px;font-size:.75em\">1-1</span></td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap;color:#6b7280\">1-15V2</td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;color:#374151\">Total da CBS da União. vCBS = vBC × (pCBS ou pAliqEfetCBS).</td></tr></tbody></table></div>"}]